IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
AUTHOR. 'TREVOR LITTLE'.
PROGRAM-ID. FACTORIAL.

DATA DIVISION.
  WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 WS-SP PIC 9(3).
    01 WS-ANS PIC 9(10).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  ACCEPT WS-SP FROM CONSOLE.
  
  MOVE WS-SP TO WS-ANS.

  PERFORM SUB_AND_MULT UNTIL WS-SP = 1.  
  DISPLAY WS-ANS.
  
STOP RUN.

SUB_AND_MULT.
  SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-SP GIVING WS-SP.
  MULTIPLY WS-SP BY WS-ANS.
